// You send in the thread while the chat beside it is scrolled up: the
// thread goes to its newest, the chat does not move (review table row 9;
// layer 1: a thread send moves only the thread's list). The chat is
// scrolled up once the thread is open, which can move it.
// check: send hold=chat land=end@thread
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{chat}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"thread": "newest"}
{"wait": 1.5}
{"scroll": 900}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "send", "for": 5}
{"type": "a reply from the journey check", "return": true}
{"wait": 4.5}
